{"id":"548dca61df509e98","group":"89","path":"89/89-thm-normalization.md","title":"Normalization Theorem","display":"thm-normalization — Normalization Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-thm-normalization","aliases":["89-thm-normalization"],"display":"thm-normalization — Normalization Theorem","depends_on":["[[89-df-box-modality]]","[[89-df-modal-formula]]","[[89-df-necessitation]]","[[89-df-normal-modal-logic]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-thm-normalization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-thm-normalization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-normalization — Normalization Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d246470e97fec132\" href=\"?note=d246470e97fec132\" title=\"89-df-box-modality\">89-df-box-modality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c0935403945ab4ea\" href=\"?note=c0935403945ab4ea\" title=\"89-df-necessitation\">89-df-necessitation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bdef52f3ff411531\" href=\"?note=bdef52f3ff411531\" title=\"89-df-normal-modal-logic\">89-df-normal-modal-logic</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(L\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Normal}(L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Normal}(L)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box^{0}A\\coloneqq A\">\\(\\Box^{0}A\\coloneqq A\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box^{n+1}A\\coloneqq\\Box(\\Box^{n}A)\">\\(\\Box^{n+1}A\\coloneqq\\Box(\\Box^{n}A)\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}normalization}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Normal}(L)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\bigl(A\\in L\\Longrightarrow\\Box^{n}A\\in L\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}normalization}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Normal}(L)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\bigl(A\\in L\\Longrightarrow\\Box^{n}A\\in L\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> : 正态模态逻辑 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"bdef52f3ff411531\" href=\"?note=bdef52f3ff411531\" title=\"89-df-normal-modal-logic\">89-df-normal-modal-logic</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\">\\(\\Box\\)</span> : 模态算子</li>\n<li>这是必然化规则的有限迭代闭包，不主张一般的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\leftrightarrow\\Box A\">\\(A\\leftrightarrow\\Box A\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-box-modality","status":"resolved","id":"d246470e97fec132","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-box-modality]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","hea